            "text": "Insecure Direct Object Reference on Category ID allows Payment Bypass\n\nThe checkout routes (`/api/checkout` and `/api/checkout/manual`) fail to validate whether the `categoryId` provided for a participant actually belongs to the specified `eventId`. If an attacker supplies a `categoryId` belonging to a different event, the price calculation defaults to 0, allowing them to register while paying only the minimal administrative fee (or 0 if waived)."
